%% aoneahsan-cccs-coding-standards — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Writing, reviewing or finishing code]) --> stack{Project stack identified?}
    stack -->|no| readdocs[Read root CLAUDE.md for the<br/>Per-Project Stack Override block]
    readdocs --> stack
    stack -->|yes| write[Apply the hard rules while writing]

    write --> secrets{Any credential<br/>in the code?}
    secrets -->|yes| envvar[Move to an env var<br/>server secrets never in VITE_/NEXT_PUBLIC_]
    envvar --> threefile[Three-file commit:<br/>env module + type decl + .env.example]
    threefile --> required{Required for boot?}
    required -->|yes| loud[Fail loudly at boot<br/>name the var, never the value]
    required -->|no| degrade[Degrade gracefully]
    secrets -->|no| logging

    loud --> logging
    degrade --> logging
    logging{Any console.* call?}
    logging -->|yes| logger[Route through the project logger]
    logging -->|no| dead
    logger --> dead

    dead{Unused code or a TODO left?}
    dead -->|yes| delete[Delete it — never underscore-rename,<br/>never leave a placeholder]
    dead -->|no| gates
    delete --> gates

    gates[Run typecheck + lint + build]
    gates --> clean{Zero errors AND<br/>zero warnings?}
    clean -->|no| triage{Real bug or lint noise?}
    triage -->|real bug| fix[Fix the code properly<br/>no workarounds]
    triage -->|noise| config[Fix the ESLint/TS config,<br/>not the symptom]
    fix --> gates
    config --> gates
    clean -->|yes| done([Ready to commit —<br/>hand off to git-workflow])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class stack,secrets,required,logging,dead,clean,triage gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
